  "question": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> is a non-zero real&nbsp;number and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>49</mn></munderover><msup><mi>M</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></math>. If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi></math>, then&nbsp;the positive integral value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> is ______."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>I</mi></math></p><p>Also given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>49</mn></munderover><msup><mi>M</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>98</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced><mi>I</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>49</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mi>I</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>N</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>98</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>N</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>98</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now comparing with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi></math></p><p>We get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>.</p>"
  }
